OL,3,GNEWSASeafront home which inspired
OL,4,AMiddlemarch author seeks holiday let
OL,5,Ago-ahead
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe owner of a seafront home which is
OL,8,Fsaid to have inspired a prominent
OL,9,FVictorian novelist is seeking
OL,10,Fpermission to continue using it in part
OL,11,Fas a holiday let.
OL,13,FAn application to Pembrokeshire Coast
OL,14,FNational Park said Gwynne House, in
OL,15,FTenby, had been operating as a holiday
OL,16,Flet prior to its current owner
OL,17,Facquiring it in 2021.
OL,19,FThe house is Grade-II listed and forms
OL,20,Fone of a pair of early 19th-Century
OL,21,Fhouses overlooking the town's harbour,
OL,22,Fin a conservation area.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
