OL,3,GNEWSASeafront home which inspired
OL,4,AMiddlemarch author seeks holiday let
OL,5,Ago-ahead
OL,6,
OL,7,FA plaque on the front states that
OL,8,FGeorge Eliot, the pen name of Mary Ann
OL,9,FEvans who wrote Middlemarch, had been
OL,10,Finspired to write her debut novel after
OL,11,Fstaying there in 1857.
